geist, it was moved by a talisman and put the talisman in its bottle, embarking on a journey of chivalry.","abilities":["Starts with 3 <Talismans>; attacks attach a <Talisman> to the target when carrying a <Talisman>"],"levelCount":1,"level":0,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":false,"moveSpeed":1,"stats":{"hp":14000,"atk":500,"def":400,"res":30,"elementalRes":0,"elementalDamageRes":0,"attackInterval":4}},"pseudomut":{"slug":"pseudomut","name":"Pseudomut","icon":"/enemies-icons/Pseudomut.webp","rank":"Elite","race":"Apparition","movement":"Ground","attackPosition":"Melee","damageType":["Physical"],"flavourText":"Similar in appearance to a Feranmut, it looks like an ancient 'God', but it is no more than a mere beast. It has become extinct in modern times, for its greed never diminished, despite no longer having the reputation of the Feranmuts to draw from.","abilities":["When blocked for the first time, devours the blocker and gains Low-Altitude Hovering","Returns devoured Operator when defeated"],"levelCount":1,"level":0,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":false,"moveSpeed":0.6,"stats":{"hp":35000,"atk":450,"def":1500,"res":40,"elementalRes":null,"elementalDamageRes":null,"attackInterval":4}},"heartbillow":{"slug":"heartbillow","name":"Heartbillow","icon":"/enemies-icons/Heartbillow.webp","rank":"Elite","race":"Apparition","movement":"Ground","attackPosition":"Ranged","damageType":["Physical"],"flavourText":"A Waregeist that manifested when it was infected by Sui-Xiang. The crouching demon and sleeping dragon solemnly stand guard and ward off evil, and though the paperweight was once stately and majestic, it is now anxious and restless, always ready to attack.","abilities":["Spawns 15 <Rosewood Paperweights> when defeated"],"levelCount":1,"level":0,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":false,"moveSpeed":0.8,"stats":{"hp":7600,"atk":500,"def":500,"res":30,"elementalRes":null,"elementalDamageRes":null,"attackInterval":2.2}},"sharpedge":{"slug":"sharpedge","nam