ehavioral patterns are particularly complex, perhaps even more so than mere man. Arts can shift Hui and Ming.","abilities":["Can charge its attacks. If not interrupted, causes Arts damage and shifts target's Ming and Hui attribute."],"levelCount":1,"level":0,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":false,"moveSpeed":0.8,"stats":{"hp":15000,"atk":700,"def":220,"res":50,"elementalRes":null,"elementalDamageRes":null,"attackInterval":4}},"yi":{"slug":"yi","name":"Yi","icon":"/enemies-icons/Yi.webp","rank":"Boss","race":"Apparition","movement":"Ground","attackPosition":"Ranged","damageType":["Arts"],"flavourText":"Build pillars and towers from clouds and earth, and make pairs out of like and like.","abilities":["First Form","Starts with Hui attribute and attacks 2 targets simultaneously, prioritizing units with the opposite Hui-Ming Attribute","[Amalgam] Periodically enters a casting state to change his Hui-Ming Attribute","[Summon Liangs] Periodically summons <Liangs> from both sides of the map","Second Form","[Amalgam] Periodically enters a casting state to change his Hui-Ming Attribute and gain Barrier","[Summon Liangs] Periodically summons more <Liangs> from both sides of the map"],"levelCount":1,"level":0,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":false,"moveSpeed":0.5,"stats":{"hp":150000,"atk":1200,"def":1500,"res":60,"elementalRes":0,"elementalDamageRes":0,"attackInterval":3.5}},"body_of_sui":{"slug":"body_of_sui","name":"'Body of Sui'","icon":"/enemies-icons/'Body of Sui'.webp","rank":"Boss","race":"Apparition","movement":"Flying","attackPosition":"Melee","damageType":["Physical"],"flavourText":"Formed from ink and sculptures, It hides in the clouds, waiting for the opportunity to extinguish the candle of mankind.","abilities":["Does not normally exist on the battlefield; locks on to your unit with the most nearby units, triggering [Sleepless]","[Sleepless] Forces the target and Operators in the 8 surrounding tiles to retreat, temporarily creating undeployable for a w